  <blockquote class="evidence">YouTube's reference bitrates for SDR uploads at standard frame rates run from 1 Mbps at 360p to 80 to 160 Mbps at 8K, with 8 Mbps at 1080p and 35 to 45 Mbps at 4K. Audio: 128 kbps mono, 384 kbps stereo, 512 kbps for 5.1.</blockquote>
